B.biD=new A.aP("Privacy Policy",'# Privacy Policy\n\n**Effective Date:** February 2025  \n**Company:** Red Domino Precision Pilot\n\n## 1. Introduction\n\nRed Domino Precision Pilot ("we," "our," or "the Company") operates the Precision Pilot mobile and web application. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your personal information when you use our services.\n\n## 2. Information We Collect\n\n### 2.1 Information You Provide\n- **Account Information:** Email address, display name, password (encrypted)\n- **Driver Information:** PRIME driver code, TIN (Tax Identification Number), phone number, address, date of birth, CDL number and state, CDL expiry, employment type, hire date, emergency contact name and phone\n- **Truck Information:** VIN, license plate, insurance details (for fleet management)\n\n### 2.2 Information Collected Automatically\n- Device information (type, operating system)\n- Usage data (features used, session duration)\n- Location data (when you use route planning, fuel stops, or IFTA tracking\u2014with your consent)\n\n## 3. How We Use Your Information\n\nWe use your information to:\n- Provide and maintain the Precision Pilot application\n- Process settlements and calculate driver pay (CPM, bonuses)\n- Generate 1099 and tax-related documents for contractors\n- Manage fleet assignments (trucks, loads)\n- Send notifications (load assignments, settlement ready, maintenance reminders)\n- Improve our services and user experience\n- Comply with legal and regulatory requirements\n\n## 4. How We Protect Your Information\n\n- **Encryption:** Sensitive data (passwords, TIN) is encrypted in transit (TLS) and at rest\n- **Access Controls:** Role-based access; drivers see only their own data; owners see fleet-wide data\n- **Secure Storage:** Firebase (Google Cloud) with security rules enforcing data isolation\n- **Authentication:** Multiple secure sign-in options (password, biometrics, magic link)\n- **Audit:** We monitor access and maintain logs for security purposes\n\n## 5. Data Sharing and Disclosure\n\nWe do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:\n- **Service Providers:** Firebase/Google Cloud (hosting, auth, database)\n- **Legal Requirements:** When required by law or to protect our rights\n- **With Your Consent:** When you explicitly authorize sharing\n\n## 6. Data Retention\n\n- Account and profile data: Retained while your account is active and for 7 years after termination (tax/legal compliance)\n- Usage logs: Typically 90 days\n- You may request deletion of your data; we will comply subject to legal retention requirements\n\n## 7. Your Rights\n\nYou have the right to:\n- Access your personal data\n- Correct inaccurate data\n- Request deletion (subject to legal retention)\n- Opt out of non-essential communications\n- Withdraw consent where consent is the legal basis\n\nContact us at the address below to exercise these rights.\n\n## 8. Children\'s Privacy\n\nOur services are not intended for individuals under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors.\n\n## 9. Changes to This Policy\n\nWe may update this Privacy Policy. We will notify you of material changes via the app or email. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.\n\n## 10. Contact Us\n\n**Red Domino Precision Pilot**  \nFor privacy inquiries or to exercise your rights, contact your fleet manager or the company administrator.\n')
